<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:10:43 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“实施失败”：人工智能在一些中断中发挥了关键作用，但并不像你想象的那样</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/ai-played-a-major-role-in-the-nsa-banking-outages-but-not-in-the-way-you-may-think/</link><description>使用人工智能工具来查找漏洞以及对人工智能网络攻击的恐惧正在推动对现有软件的疯狂修补，其中一些有缺陷的补丁会导致中断。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2271848081-e1795031217617.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:09:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/ai-played-a-major-role-in-the-nsa-banking-outages-but-not-in-the-way-you-may-think/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic IPO 定价为每股 83 美元，估值达 1.5 万亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/anthropic-prices-ipo-83-per-share-1-5-trillion/</link><description>该 Claude AI 产品的制造商定价高于其范围，预计将于周四开始交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GettyImages-2297198536_6aa9df-e1795039499175.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:07:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/anthropic-prices-ipo-83-per-share-1-5-trillion/</guid></item><item><title>摩根大通任命拥有 20 年公司经验的 Bregje de Best 为其下一任首席财务官</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/jpmorgan-taps-20-year-company-veteran-bregje-de-best-as-its-next-cfo/</link><description>她将接替杰里米·巴纳姆（Jeremy Barnum），后者已担任该职位六年。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bregje-de-Best.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:29:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/jpmorgan-taps-20-year-company-veteran-bregje-de-best-as-its-next-cfo/</guid></item><item><title>大肖恩和杰伦·罗斯成就了大事。现在他们要确保自己继续为这座养育他们的城市效力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/big-sean-jalen-rose-detroit-giving-back-next-generation/</link><description>从录音室到教室，底特律当地人正在为下一代投资，并证明成功并不意味着忘记家乡。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/55661055170_c29299d4a3_o-e1795033429498.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:31:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/big-sean-jalen-rose-detroit-giving-back-next-generation/</guid></item><item><title>受成本上涨的挤压，Z 世代仍在购买保健品和唇彩</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/gen-z-spending-habits-pacsun-ulta-upstart/</link><description>Pacsun、Ulta 和 Upstart 的高管表示，由于高价格和薄弱的信用记录挤压了年轻消费者的消费意愿，他们的消费意愿更加强烈。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/55658669481_6023f42cb6_3k.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:45:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/gen-z-spending-habits-pacsun-ulta-upstart/</guid></item><item><title>俄克拉荷马州州长认为大学“陷入困境”。他的解决方案——三年制学士学位——已经迅速传播开来</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/oklahoma-governor-stitt-three-year-college-degree-fortune-500-innovation-forum/</link><description>“学术界有点固守自己的方式，”俄克拉荷马州州长凯文·斯蒂特告诉《财富》杂志。 “他们不喜欢改变。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/kevin-stitt-fortune-500-innovation-forum-2026.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:48:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/oklahoma-governor-stitt-three-year-college-degree-fortune-500-innovation-forum/</guid></item><item><title>Chipotle、Macy&amp;#39;s 和 Ally 首席执行官探讨为什么当购物者对高价望而却步时，忠诚度福利变得更加重要</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/chipotle-macys-ally-ceo-loyalty-programs-consumer-prices/</link><description>顶级品牌正在利用忠诚度计划来满足寻求优惠的消费者。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/55658877860_daa41d2d67_k.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:43:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/chipotle-macys-ally-ceo-loyalty-programs-consumer-prices/</guid></item><item><title>技术行业领导者承认“没有什么是面向未来的”——但人工智能无法取代美国对汽车技术人员等蓝领工人不断增长的需求</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/skilled-trades-work-augmented-but-not-replaced-by-ai-six-figure-salary-potential-opportunity-for-gen-z-ford-carhartt-jobs-for-the-future/</link><description>福特和 Carhartt 领导人表示，人工智能将增加蓝领工作岗位，但不会改变行业每年填补 170 万个熟练劳动力岗位的需求。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/55659066376_0a7444752c_o-e1795017049196.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:20:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/skilled-trades-work-augmented-but-not-replaced-by-ai-six-figure-salary-potential-opportunity-for-gen-z-ford-carhartt-jobs-for-the-future/</guid></item><item><title>“70%的可能性”我们已经陷入人工智能泡沫：一月份说“还没有”的经济学家现在看到了泡沫末日的所有四骑士</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/ai-bubble-owen-lamont-70-percent-four-horsemen-stock-issuance-anthropic-ipo/</link><description>“今年发生了很多变化，”阿卡迪亚的欧文·拉蒙特告诉《财富》杂志。一个重要的说明是“聪明的钱”正在做什么——抛售股票。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1158933047-e1793370730248.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/ai-bubble-owen-lamont-70-percent-four-horsemen-stock-issuance-anthropic-ipo/</guid></item><item><title>由于互联网上存在缺陷的补丁破坏了银行和航空公司，华盛顿说服 4 个人工智能聊天机器人策划恐怖袭击</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/gao-ai-chatbots-attack-plans-hassan-patching-nsa-outages/</link><description>参议员玛吉·哈桑 (Maggie Hassan) 表示：“如果国会不采取行动，那么问题是坏人何时（而不是是否）会使用人工智能来计划和实施重大攻击。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/maggie-hassan-senate-help.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:29:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/11/18/gao-ai-chatbots-attack-plans-hassan-patching-nsa-outages/</guid></item></channel></rss>